 wagons, and of the chariots…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Joel 2:10","note":"The earth quakes before them. The heavens tremble. The sun and the moon are darkened, and the stars withdraw their shining.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}